    "title": "mspdf-preview — live PDF preview while you code.",
    "version": "27.0.0-alpha.1",
    "description": "Live PDF preview while you code. Watches a PDF file (or runs your project under `dotnet watch` and watches its output) and auto-reloads a browser tab on every rebuild. A dev-time companion tool for Majorsilence.Pdf — not a runtime dependency."
